{"id":"b24b7b7e0c7a4c7e","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Payoff Function","display":"df-zfc-game3-payoff-function — ZFC Game3 Payoff Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-payoff-function — ZFC Game3 Payoff Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-payoff-function — ZFC Game3 Payoff Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (move alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (finite-history tree candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (player set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> (utility-function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\)</span> (finite sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (utility-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PayoffFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PayoffFunction}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PayoffFunction}_S(H,A,I,u)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land H\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land H\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists T\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{t\\in H:\\neg\\exists v\\in H\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(v)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\land\nv\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(t)=t)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PayoffFunction}_S(H,A,I,u)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land H\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land H\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists T\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{t\\in H:\\neg\\exists v\\in H\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(v)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\land\nv\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(t)=t)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Utilities are defined exactly on the terminal positions of a prefix-closed finite-history tree.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)$ (finite sequence predicate, see [[58-df-finite-sequence]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)$ (utility-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PayoffFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3PayoffFunction}_S(H,A,I,u)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land H\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land H\\subseteq\\{s:\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,A)\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\in H\\;\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright n\\in H)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists T\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{t\\in H:\\neg\\exists v\\in H\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(v)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\land\nv\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(t)=t)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,I\\times T,\\mathbb R)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1536,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function.md|58-df-zfc-game3-payoff-function]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f4bf86f66c1444da","36d7463d215be751"]}